		"Everything else opens with the Stone Age."
	]
	quest.16708A1C39158F9C.title: "What Dawn Locks"
	quest.17A29F90313EDA66.quest_desc: [
		"A garden cloche grows crops under glass with power and water."
	]
	quest.17A29F90313EDA66.title: "Garden Cloche"
	quest.188B8BAD88328299.quest_desc: [
		"Magic comes to the Firmament: Occultism spirits, Ars Nouveau source and Theurgy alchemy."
		"Until the Information Age magic gives the best ore yield, the first endless ore and the"
		"first item logistics."
		""
		"Three strands lead to the Arcane Keystone: Spirits, Source and Alchemy."
	]
	quest.188B8BAD88328299.quest_subtitle: "Age 3"
	quest.188B8BAD88328299.title: "Welcome to the Arcane Age"
