		"The infuser makes the Mekanism alloys and the control circuits."
	]
	quest.1BAB0B9CCD6A8CB3.title: "Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.1BC2A62B4D301274.quest_desc: [
		"Hot items glow. The tooltip shows the temperature; metal melts at its own heat."
	]
	quest.1BC2A62B4D301274.title: "Heat Colors"
	quest.1BDBAA8EB6E2DA83.quest_desc: [
		"Factory gauges keep a production line stocked by themselves."
	]
	quest.1BDBAA8EB6E2DA83.title: "Factory Gauge"
	quest.1BDF51DA8C6CA794.quest_desc: [
		"The metal press makes TFC sheets from two ingots, rods and wire."
	]
	quest.1BDF51DA8C6CA794.title: "Metal Press"
	quest.1BF2818DC437F21D.quest_desc: [
		"Red steel is the Age 5 metal: weak red steel worked on the anvil, then a sheet."
	]
	quest.1BF2818DC437F21D.title: "Red Steel"
	quest.1C3849490BE7F034.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Naga in its courtyard."]
	quest.1C3849490BE7F034.title: "The Naga"
	quest.1CC29E163A94FCE6.quest_desc: [
		"Place unfired pottery, cover it with straw and logs and set it on fire: a pit kiln."
	]
	quest.1CC29E163A94FCE6.title: "Potter"
	quest.1CEE5246AF1BDCB2.quest_desc: [
		"Render fat into tallow and make candles. Light without fire hazards."
	]
	quest.1CEE5246AF1BDCB2.title: "Tallow and Candles"
	quest.1D238635FCC5C642.quest_desc: [
		"Build a crafting CPU and let the network craft a 64k storage component."
	]
	quest.1D238635FCC5C642.title: "Autocrafting Online"
	quest.1D5C854562BD6F58.quest_desc: [
		"Dial The Origin and step through the gate. Hold out against the waves of the Gateway,"
		"Maledictus and Ignis among them, then face the final boss."
		""
		"Its fall completes the Firmament and unlocks the trophies: the MekaSuit and the Meka-Tool."
	]
	quest.1D5C854562BD6F58.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Singularity Age: the end of the road"
	quest.1D5C854562BD6F58.title: "Beyond the Firmament"
	quest.1D842B40E0C51F06.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium, fission, the first rockets to the Moon and Mars, and Draconic Evolution."
		""
		"Four strands lead to the Star Chart: Atomic, Rocketry & Moon, Mars and Draconium."
	]
	quest.1D842B40E0C51F06.quest_subtitle: "Age 7"
	quest.1D842B40E0C51F06.title: "Welcome to the Space Age"
	quest.1E05714D0F44B25C.quest_desc: [
		"The diesel generator is the one FE generator of this Age. Feed it diesel from the Oil strand."
	]
	quest.1E05714D0F44B25C.title: "Diesel Generator"
	quest.1E1F3E3E6C4E81FD.quest_desc: [
		"A core sample drill shows what lies under a chunk, oil included."
	]
	quest.1E1F3E3E6C4E81FD.title: "Core Sample"
	quest.1E2B67282F83843D.quest_desc: [
		"Three ore routes now: Create crushing wheels (about 1.5 to 1.9 times), Theurgy spagyrics"
		"(only rich pieces, about 2.5 times) and the Dimensional Mineshaft (endless rich pieces)."
		"The Occultism crusher grinds only Occultism's own materials, no ore."
	]
	quest.1E2B67282F83843D.title: "Ore in the Arcane Age"
	quest.1F3F85FE5B0041D8.quest_desc: ["Rockets are built at the NASA workbench."]
	quest.1F3F85FE5B0041D8.title: "NASA Workbench"
	quest.1FC065AF7A77E6DD.quest_desc: [
		"The accumulator gathers sal ammoniac, the solvent of every liquefaction."
	]
	quest.1FC065AF7A77E6DD.title: "Sal Ammoniac"
	quest.1FD61E2A23294166.quest_desc: ["Chaos shards drop from the guardian's crystals."]
	quest.1FD61E2A23294166.title: "Chaos Shards"
	quest.2004E11B844D1C4B.quest_desc: [
		"Each Age has its own chapter. A chapter appears when your team reaches its Age."
		"Recipes of a later Age do not exist yet, anywhere: not in the crafting grid, not in machines."
		"EMI shows them once their Age is unlocked."
		""
		"Ores of later Ages look like plain stone until their Age."
	]
	quest.2004E11B844D1C4B.title: "The Ages"
	quest.203071592A4D660A.quest_desc: [
		"Four straw make one block of thatch. It is the only building block of Dawn."
	]
	quest.203071592A4D660A.title: "Thatch"
	quest.2036F321608B520E.quest_desc: ["Patterns and assemblers craft on request."]
	quest.2036F321608B520E.title: "Molecular Assembler"
	quest.206BCC87705BB466.quest_desc: ["Knap a javelin head and shaft it. Throw it or stab with it."]
	quest.206BCC87705BB466.title: "A Stone Javelin"
	quest.2070B77706F2CB8E.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Sky Disc: a bronze double sheet from the bronze anvil and gold sheets."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its second ring, the Bronze Sanctum: rock bricks, four bronze blocks and"
		"a bronze bell. Use the heart with an empty hand to see the missing blocks."
		"Lay the Sky Disc on the new plinth, ring the bell and pray at the heart."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Sky Disc as a relic and opens the Iron Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.2070B77706F2CB8E.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Bronze Age: Caelum opens the Iron Age"
	quest.2070B77706F2CB8E.title: "Offer the Sky Disc at the Shrine"
	quest.20986504959DC566.quest_desc: [
		"Melt copper with tin, bismuth or gold and silver in the right ratio."
	]
	quest.20986504959DC566.title: "Bronze"
	quest.214D6B55DD018CDF.quest_desc: [
		"Dig a cellar below ground: it stays cool. Fill large vessels and seal them."
	]
	quest.214D6B55DD018CDF.title: "Cellar Vessels"
	quest.2184B4EB21075F37.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Tesla Crown around the Foundry Nave: a 15 by 15 border of aluminium sheetmetal or"
		"aluminium blocks, red steel block bases with HV capacitors, aluminium scaffolding two high and"
		"four floodlights on top, with the sixth plinth in the middle of the north side."
	]
	quest.2184B4EB21075F37.quest_subtitle: "Optional: the shrine ring of this Age"
	quest.2184B4EB21075F37.title: "Raise the Tesla Crown"
	quest.21B580750CD1579A.quest_desc: [
		"Afrits need an HV coil block for their book. They run the Dimensional Battlefield."
	]
	quest.21B580750CD1579A.title: "Bind an Afrit"
	quest.21C2AA41F93E700F.quest_desc: ["The Ender Dragon now drops its heart."]
	quest.21C2AA41F93E700F.title: "Dragon Heart"
	quest.222144A9AFE56147.quest_desc: ["The pressurized reaction chamber makes HDPE from ethene."]
	quest.222144A9AFE56147.title: "HDPE"
	quest.2303CB5F822C38B6.quest_desc: [
		"The apparatus on an arcane core with pedestals crafts the Ars items. It is the one magic"
		"pedestal crafting of this Age."
	]
	quest.2303CB5F822C38B6.title: "Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.23536BC1524A5044.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse the Humming Core in the arc furnace: an HV capacitor with an Attuned Circuit,"
		"four aluminium plates, two red steel sheets and a Nether Star."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its sixth ring, the Tesla Crown: a 15 by 15 border of aluminium,"
		"red steel block bases, HV capacitors, aluminium scaffolding and four floodlights on top."
		"Lay the Humming Core on the new plinth, light the floodlights (power and a redstone signal)"
		"and pray at the heart."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Humming Core as a relic and opens the Information Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.23536BC1524A5044.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Electric Age: Caelum opens the Information Age"
	quest.23536BC1524A5044.title: "Offer the Humming Core at the Shrine"
	quest.23B75CB262B7C101.quest_desc: ["Mix clay with kaolinite and graphite powder into fire clay."]
	quest.23B75CB262B7C101.title: "Fireproof"
	quest.23B8CBEFB688315B.quest_desc: [
		"Cast the pig iron. Hammer it into high carbon steel, then into steel."
	]
	quest.23B8CBEFB688315B.title: "Pig Iron"
	quest.23C92958F20BE038.quest_desc: ["A water wheel in flowing water gives rotational force."]
	quest.23C92958F20BE038.title: "Water Wheel"
	quest.2444E19A6383B59C.quest_desc: ["Hammer the bloom on an anvil until it becomes wrought iron."]
	quest.2444E19A6383B59C.title: "The Iron Age"
	quest.245F94A13DBFA3D1.quest_desc: [
		"A giant sleeps in the cold lands. Wake it and take its ice crystal."
	]
	quest.245F94A13DBFA3D1.title: "Frostmaw"
	quest.24B73E0B6F871DEE.quest_desc: [
		"Spawn fluids turn into mobs: only those of the current mob stage."
	]
	quest.24B73E0B6F871DEE.title: "Mechanical Spawner"
	quest.24E7968E14C34C9C.quest_desc: ["Cut tall grass with a stone knife to get straw."]
	quest.24E7968E14C34C9C.title: "Grasping at Straws"
	quest.2562E428698729A6.quest_desc: ["Land on Venus."]
	quest.2562E428698729A6.title: "Venus"
	quest.2636919E4AB2F40C.quest_desc: ["Desh builds the tier 2 rocket."]
	quest.2636919E4AB2F40C.title: "Tier 2 Rocket"
	quest.2640D22EE4D7FCF3.quest_desc: ["An advanced smelting factory smelts five stacks at once."]
	quest.2640D22EE4D7FCF3.title: "Advanced Factory"
	quest.26D594F0567CC39A.quest_desc: [
		"A bronze anvil forges bronze double sheets: the Sky Disc needs one."
	]
	quest.26D594F0567CC39A.title: "Bronze Anvil"
	quest.271B9FEFDBDBD98F.quest_desc: ["Weld two hot ingots into a double ingot on the stone anvil."]
	quest.271B9FEFDBDBD98F.title: "Double Trouble"
	quest.280FF1CBD99D0A4A.quest_desc: [
		"Dissolution, washing and crystallizing give five times the metal."
	]
	quest.280FF1CBD99D0A4A.title: "Ore Times Five"
	quest.289281EB5946B550.quest_desc: [
		"Andesite alloy is TFC andesite cobble and zinc nuggets. It is the base of Create."
	]
	quest.289281EB5946B550.title: "Andesite Alloy"
	quest.28A963AA218A4EE4.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Steel Heart: a steel sheet, a precision mechanism, wrought iron double sheets"
		"and the Lich trophy."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its third ring, the Iron Sanctum: four pillars of smooth rock with"
		"wrought iron bars and four wrought iron lamps. Use the heart to see the missing blocks."
		"Lay the Steel Heart on the new plinth, light the four lamps and pray at the heart."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Steel Heart as a relic and opens the Arcane Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.28A963AA218A4EE4.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Iron Age: Caelum opens the Arcane Age"
	quest.28A963AA218A4EE4.title: "Offer the Steel Heart at the Shrine"
	quest.29BB85F4AE1E4A82.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion power, the SPS, rockets to Venus, Mercury and Glacio, awakened draconium and the Marid."
		""
		"Four strands lead to the Quantum Core: Fusion, Inner Planets, Awakened and Marid."
		"The Quantum Core is the last offering at the shrine."
	]
	quest.29BB85F4AE1E4A82.quest_subtitle: "Age 8"
	quest.29BB85F4AE1E4A82.title: "Welcome to the Quantum Age"
	quest.29BF6EA4F2FCD8F4.quest_desc: [
		"Mine the tin and zinc veins you found and cast their ingots."
	]
	quest.29BF6EA4F2FCD8F4.title: "First Mine"
	quest.2AA19A118F3D7E22.quest_desc: [
		"Metal can only be worked or welded while it is hot enough. Check the tooltip color."
	]
	quest.2AA19A118F3D7E22.title: "Working Heat"
	quest.2C575E91F55039E2.quest_desc: [
		"Mercury, salt and sulfur incubate into a canonical metal dust. Melt the dust in a TFC vessel."
	]
	quest.2C575E91F55039E2.title: "Incubator"
	quest.2CDFC10C1482A709.quest_desc: ["The FE generator of this Age."]
	quest.2CDFC10C1482A709.title: "Gas-Burning Generator"
	quest.2CEDC0346E550CE6.quest_desc: [
		"A TFC year has seasons. Crops stop growing in winter and it gets cold. Plan ahead."
	]
	quest.2CEDC0346E550CE6.title: "The First Winter"
	quest.2DC5143776D7B7D7.quest_desc: [
		"Sixteen steel ingots. From here on, steel is a material, not a trophy."
	]
	quest.2DC5143776D7B7D7.title: "Steel Ingots"
	quest.2EC89EF1F5DED2A1.quest_desc: ["The saw cuts TFC logs into lumber."]
	quest.2EC89EF1F5DED2A1.title: "Mechanical Saw"
	quest.2F40BC4F2411937D.quest_desc: ["Cassiterite pieces on the ground point to a tin vein below."]
	quest.2F40BC4F2411937D.title: "Tin on the Surface"
	quest.2F5F52EBC70FEF35.quest_desc: [
		"The fired small vessel melts ore when it sits in a fire or a pit kiln."
	]
	quest.2F5F52EBC70FEF35.title: "Small Vessel"
	quest.30A13F8701E9EF80.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Hearth Circle around the heart: eight cobblestone of any rock around it, four log"
		"posts two blocks high on the corners of a 5x5 square with thatch on top, and an Offering Plinth"
		"(four cobblestone) two blocks from the heart."
		"Use the heart with an empty hand to see the missing blocks in place."
		""
		"When the circle is complete, the heart glows. Use it again: it names the offering Caelum asks for."
	]
	quest.30A13F8701E9EF80.title: "Raise the Shrine"
	quest.31A4263D40A1EF78.quest_desc: ["Matrices are the raw output of the simulation."]
	quest.31A4263D40A1EF78.title: "Prediction Matrices"
	quest.31AD386737065FFF.quest_desc: [
		"Build the fission reactor. Cool it well: a hot reactor melts down."
	]
	quest.31AD386737065FFF.title: "Fission Reactor"
	quest.31D8D96B76A155E7.quest_desc: ["Draconic tools have direct recipes from the awakened core."]
	quest.31D8D96B76A155E7.title: "Draconic Tools"
	quest.3213BFEF5EB29C5C.quest_desc: [
		"Fire an ingot mold and a pickaxe head mold. They take liquid copper."
	]
	quest.3213BFEF5EB29C5C.title: "Mold Set"
	quest.3240A673372AF11A.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 0: Stone Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.3240A673372AF11A.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 0: Stone Age"
	quest.3240A673372AF11A.title: "Hearthstone"
	quest.32C8626D60896E8F.quest_desc: [
		"Pick up a loose rock from the ground. Rocks are knapped by using them in hand."
	]
	quest.32C8626D60896E8F.title: "Just a Rock"
	quest.32D33BE8EB20FCA6.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 5: Electric Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.32D33BE8EB20FCA6.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 5: Electric Age"
	quest.32D33BE8EB20FCA6.title: "Humming Core"
	quest.333133C7E32AE19D.quest_desc: ["Thirty-two aluminium plates from the metal press."]
	quest.333133C7E32AE19D.title: "Aluminium Plates"
	quest.33818E6B3089AF9E.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 7: Space Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.33818E6B3089AF9E.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 7: Space Age"
	quest.33818E6B3089AF9E.title: "Star Chart"
	quest.33BEA94E7673D21D.quest_desc: [
		"TFC has no nether portals. Beneath opens the Nether through a sacrifice ritual:"
		"its field guide shows the altar and the offering. Step through and look for iesnium."
	]
	quest.33BEA94E7673D21D.title: "Beneath"
	quest.3439831B7895C627.quest_desc: [
		"Each magic function has one carrier: Starbuncles move items, Dimensional Storage stores them,"
		"Theurgy multiplies ore, the Djinni crafts in pentacles. Duplicates are switched off."
	]
	quest.3439831B7895C627.title: "One Carrier per Function"
	quest.349C4476B51DAC16.quest_desc: [
		"Fill the bloomery with iron ore and charcoal and let it burn."
	]
	quest.349C4476B51DAC16.title: "In Bloom"
	quest.34A20DCC53F255CC.quest_desc: [
		"The blast furnace makes pig iron from iron ore, charcoal and flux."
	]
	quest.34A20DCC53F255CC.title: "Blast Off!"
	quest.354A9C13E074B572.quest_desc: [
		"Datura seeds now drop from TFC grass. Plant them on Arcane Soil (amethyst-charged TFC dirt);"
		"TFC farmland does not hold them."
	]
	quest.354A9C13E074B572.title: "Datura"
	quest.355268AD22D21602.quest_desc: ["A desert tomb hides the Ancient Remnant."]
	quest.355268AD22D21602.title: "Ancient Remnant"
	quest.35ADF495118E2323.quest_desc: [
		"Split a TFC zinc ingot into nine zinc nuggets in the crafting grid."
	]
	quest.35ADF495118E2323.title: "Zinc Nuggets"
	quest.35AFC9346F30C43A.quest_desc: ["Naquadah lies on Mercury. Mine it with a digital miner."]
	quest.35AFC9346F30C43A.title: "Naquadah"
	quest.3674604366D3C8BE.quest_desc: [
		"The Dictionary of Spirits explains every pentacle and ritual. Keep it on hand."
	]
	quest.3674604366D3C8BE.title: "Dictionary of Spirits"
	quest.369057F8A5EDCD0C.quest_desc: ["The deep learner trains data models while you fight."]
	quest.369057F8A5EDCD0C.title: "Deep Learner"
	quest.36A59893ED5389B6.quest_desc: ["The imbuement chamber charges items with source."]
	quest.36A59893ED5389B6.title: "Imbuement Chamber"
	quest.36C48EC86A43AA92.quest_desc: [
		"Sequenced assembly on a brass base. Many Iron Age machines need it."
	]
	quest.36C48EC86A43AA92.title: "Precision Mechanism"
	quest.373193C62E3C9E35.quest_desc: [
		"The mercury catalyst is the proof of the Alchemy strand."
		"Spagyrics give about 2.5 times the metal of a hand-smelted rich piece, the best yield until"
		"the Information Age."
	]
	quest.373193C62E3C9E35.title: "Mercury Catalyst"
	quest.38BA8AD136589CDA.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Draconic reactor and bring it online. It is the only power source for the Stargate."
	]
	quest.38BA8AD136589CDA.title: "Reactor Online"
	quest.3931946D843ABA96.quest_desc: [
		"A divination rod points to the ore veins your team has unlocked."
	]
	quest.3931946D843ABA96.title: "Divination Rod"
	quest.39882F695B4F5776.quest_desc: ["The Marid book needs atomic alloy and a wyvern core."]
	quest.39882F695B4F5776.title: "Atomic Alloy"
	quest.398B809EEA8DDFB5.quest_desc: ["MEGA cells hold far more than the AE2 cells."]
	quest.398B809EEA8DDFB5.title: "MEGA Cells"
	quest.3A0F28382F5AE922.quest_desc: ["Circuit boards carry the tubes."]
	quest.3A0F28382F5AE922.title: "Circuit Board"
	quest.3A5D0F3FAA56A074.quest_desc: ["Copper ore pieces lie on the surface above copper veins."]
	quest.3A5D0F3FAA56A074.title: "Native Copper"
	quest.3AA65FA513DA3CEC.quest_desc: ["Coke burns hot and clean. The blast furnace needs it."]
	quest.3AA65FA513DA3CEC.title: "Coal Coke"
	quest.3AD1F9C2C23677C5.quest_desc: ["Gather wild berries. Fruit is a nutrition group of its own."]
	quest.3AD1F9C2C23677C5.title: "Berries and Herbs"
	quest.3B588CB49C0F4193.quest_desc: [
		"Fire the idol in a pit kiln, like any other pottery. It becomes the Hearthstone."
	]
	quest.3B588CB49C0F4193.title: "Hearth Idol"
	quest.3B636FCBEF145ABE.quest_desc: ["Smith any bronze tool."]
	quest.3B636FCBEF145ABE.title: "The Bronze Age"
	quest.3B99EB35C7692364.quest_desc: ["Frogports send packages along chain conveyors."]
	quest.3B99EB35C7692364.title: "Frogport"
	quest.3BAC7E39FA05241C.quest_desc: [
		"Grind borax, lime or other flux stones in the quern. Welding needs flux."
	]
	quest.3BAC7E39FA05241C.title: "In Flux"
	quest.3C3FF2D0079C4F17.quest_desc: [
		"Food decays and tools wear out as in plain TerraFirmaCraft. Nothing is softened."
		"Everything you need in quantity can be automated later. Hand work comes first."
	]
	quest.3C3FF2D0079C4F17.title: "Survival Notes"
	quest.3C8510408C6A23D6.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 8: Quantum Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.3C8510408C6A23D6.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 8: Quantum Age"
	quest.3C8510408C6A23D6.title: "Quantum Core"
	quest.3CBED807D32DD158.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism purification gives three times the metal. Theurgy and the IE crusher stay usable,"
		"but Mekanism is the yield route from now on."
	]
	quest.3CBED807D32DD158.title: "Ore Tripling"
	quest.3D1D49324454F634.quest_desc: ["A full space suit with oxygen keeps you alive off-world."]
	quest.3D1D49324454F634.title: "Space Suit"
	quest.3E8ADD553D7E26A2.quest_desc: [
		"Visit Mercury. Its Naquadah is locked until the Singularity Age."
	]
	quest.3E8ADD553D7E26A2.title: "Mercury"
	quest.3EAA8BE972DC58F9.quest_desc: [
		"Alloy copper and zinc into brass, by hand in the crucible or heated in a Create basin."
	]
	quest.3EAA8BE972DC58F9.title: "Brass"
	quest.3F8D45ADF9515576.quest_desc: [
		"Confirm when your cellar holds sealed vessels with enough food for the whole team."
		"No food goes into any recipe or quest turn-in."
	]
	quest.3F8D45ADF9515576.title: "Winter Stores"
	quest.3F916E93EBA922A5.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Foundry Nave around the Spirit Circle: a 13 by 13 border of coke bricks, heavy"
		"engineering block bases, steel scaffolding three high and four electric lanterns on top,"
		"with the fifth plinth in the middle of the north side."
	]
	quest.3F916E93EBA922A5.quest_subtitle: "Optional: the shrine ring of this Age"
	quest.3F916E93EBA922A5.title: "Raise the Foundry Nave"
	quest.40280EBC4CC9F8F6.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 6: Information Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.40280EBC4CC9F8F6.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 6: Information Age"
	quest.40280EBC4CC9F8F6.title: "Data Matrix"
	quest.40B43DE8640EAB9B.quest_desc: [
		"Mining raw stone can collapse the ceiling. Support beams come with the Bronze Age."
	]
	quest.40B43DE8640EAB9B.title: "Cave-ins"
	quest.40BDDBC61D9D82C3.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Quantum Ring around the Star Spire: a 21 by 21 border of calorite blocks, SPS"
		"casings or fusion reactor frames two high and awakened draconium pylons, with the ninth plinth"
		"in the middle of the north side."
	]
	quest.40BDDBC61D9D82C3.quest_subtitle: "Optional: the shrine ring of this Age"
	quest.40BDDBC61D9D82C3.title: "Raise the Quantum Ring"
	quest.40FA4C9F6A00F51F.quest_desc: [
		"Bring 64 steel sheets from your press line through the package network."
	]
	quest.40FA4C9F6A00F51F.title: "Backfill Line"
	quest.41B3251BB5EB3A3A.quest_desc: ["Bottle the dragon's breath. The Data Matrix needs it."]
	quest.41B3251BB5EB3A3A.title: "Dragon's Breath"
	quest.41B46B0D9C0E8AB4.quest_desc: ["Sphalerite pieces point to a zinc vein. Create needs zinc."]
	quest.41B46B0D9C0E8AB4.title: "Zinc on the Surface"
	quest.41F6B8884809B526.quest_desc: [
		"Chalk draws pentacles. White chalk is enough for Foliot rituals."
	]
	quest.41F6B8884809B526.title: "White Chalk"
	quest.4207F8051EF451B3.quest_desc: [
		"Fire is tamed. Clay is yours now, and with it pottery, molds and copper."
		""
		"Four strands lead to the Hearthstone: Fire & Clay, First Metal, Camp, and Hearth & Shrine."
		"The last one raises the shrine where the Hearthstone is offered to Caelum."
	]
	quest.4207F8051EF451B3.quest_subtitle: "Age 0"
	quest.4207F8051EF451B3.title: "Welcome to the Stone Age"
	quest.420FA4D7877D2196.quest_desc: ["Pour copper into the pickaxe head mold."]
	quest.420FA4D7877D2196.title: "Pickaxe Head"
	quest.426D09E37975EC57.quest_desc: [
		"A tool for everything, built directly from the chaotic core."
	]
	quest.426D09E37975EC57.title: "Chaotic Staff"
	quest.4304B6AA00C231E8.quest_desc: [
		"Only the andesite tier of Create exists now: water wheels, saws, presses, fans and mills."
		"Crushing wheels, deployers and brass machines come with the Iron Age."
	]
	quest.4304B6AA00C231E8.title: "Create in the Bronze Age"
	quest.43FC2CC39EF5EFE5.quest_desc: ["Elite control circuits run the reactor parts."]
	quest.43FC2CC39EF5EFE5.title: "Elite Circuits"
	quest.44B3F8C53C417220.quest_desc: [
		"MV and HV power, oil, the arc furnace and the excavator. Bauxite veins are visible now."
		""
		"Four strands lead to the Humming Core: Power Grid, Oil, Aluminium & Excavator and Circuits."
	]
	quest.44B3F8C53C417220.quest_subtitle: "Age 5"
	quest.44B3F8C53C417220.title: "Welcome to the Electric Age"
	quest.44FB988268E119B4.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse the Star Chart at wyvern level: a polonium pellet as catalyst, two desh plates,"
		"two ostrum plates, a wyvern core and the Harbinger's witherite block."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its eighth ring, the Star Spire: a 19 by 19 border of steel plating,"
		"desh block pillars four high and ostrum block caps."
		"Lay the Star Chart on the new plinth and pray at night, under an open sky, without rain:"
		"Caelum wants to see the stars."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Star Chart as a relic and opens the Quantum Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.44FB988268E119B4.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Space Age: Caelum opens the Quantum Age"
	quest.44FB988268E119B4.title: "Offer the Star Chart at the Shrine"
	quest.4525E18FA6D45990.quest_desc: ["Connectors hang the wire on machines and posts."]
	quest.4525E18FA6D45990.title: "LV Connectors"
	quest.4573A3F0CD529A5B.quest_desc: ["Knap clay into the shape of the hearth idol."]
	quest.4573A3F0CD529A5B.title: "Unfired Hearth Idol"
	quest.4581C5CB23AD4CD5.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Dawn. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.4581C5CB23AD4CD5.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Dawn"
	quest.4581C5CB23AD4CD5.title: "The First Spark"
	quest.4637931365FDF60B.quest_desc: [
		"Refine the Naquadah in your arc furnace or Mekanism lines. EMI shows the route."
	]
	quest.4637931365FDF60B.title: "Refined Naquadah"
	quest.470272BFC8013E57.quest_desc: [
		"The Chimera drops the Wilden Tribute. The Arcane Keystone needs it."
	]
	quest.470272BFC8013E57.title: "Wilden Tribute"
	quest.485FE6EFB6565F6E.quest_desc: [
		"The Marid ritual awakens the Arcane Keystone. The Awakened Keystone goes into the"
		"Ultimate Singularity."
	]
	quest.485FE6EFB6565F6E.title: "Awakened Keystone"
	quest.4868CA77D43496DE.quest_desc: ["The tier 1 rocket reaches the Moon."]
	quest.4868CA77D43496DE.title: "Tier 1 Rocket"
	quest.4881717821F8F9DA.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a blaze in the Nether with an empty blaze burner. Create gets superheated mixing."
	]
	quest.4881717821F8F9DA.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.4901966F799B2493.quest_desc: [
		"Lanterns float over swamps at night. Look, then decide whether to hunt them."
	]
	quest.4901966F799B2493.title: "Lights in the Swamp"
	quest.4914DB06E3F96086.quest_desc: [
		"Bind a Djinni into a book of binding. A Djinni runs crafting rituals and the Mineshaft."
	]
	quest.4914DB06E3F96086.title: "Bind a Djinni"
	quest.49153BBE2AD958B7.quest_desc: [
		"You wake up with nothing. No pickaxe, no clay, no fire."
		""
		"Dawn has three strands: Stone, Shelter and Hunt. Split them between you."
		"When all three keystones are done, light the first fire. That is the goal of Dawn,"
		"and it opens the Stone Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.49153BBE2AD958B7.quest_subtitle: "The prologue before the first Age"
	quest.49153BBE2AD958B7.title: "Welcome to the Wild"
	quest.492F1E68565B651C.quest_desc: [
		"Precision Prospecting shows the direction and size of a vein."
	]
	quest.492F1E68565B651C.title: "Mineral Prospector"
	quest.4954E2BC98921D04.quest_desc: ["Eight antimatter pellets. Two go into the Quantum Core."]
	quest.4954E2BC98921D04.title: "Antimatter Pellets"
	quest.498E3CB76B5E962C.quest_desc: [
		"Processors are made by Create sequenced assembly (Create: Applied Kinetics)."
		"The inscriber has no processor recipes in this pack."
	]
	quest.498E3CB76B5E962C.title: "Processors"
	quest.49AD8E5EC6FB24F9.quest_desc: [
		"Four stabilizers and an injector hold the reactor core in its field."
	]
	quest.49AD8E5EC6FB24F9.title: "Reactor Parts"
	quest.4A34D752E7A4B499.quest_desc: [
		"A large vessel stores food. Sealed, it slows decay. Food decay is real in this pack."
	]
	quest.4A34D752E7A4B499.title: "Stocked Camp"
	quest.4B5686EB34477AC2.quest_desc: [
		"The chaotic core is the catalyst of the Ultimate Singularity."
	]
	quest.4B5686EB34477AC2.title: "Chaotic Core"
	quest.4BFBAC45968A80F5.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Star Spire around the Data Nave: a 19 by 19 border of steel plating, desh block"
		"pillars four high and ostrum block caps, with the eighth plinth in the middle of the"
		"north side."
	]
	quest.4BFBAC45968A80F5.quest_subtitle: "Optional: the shrine ring of this Age"
	quest.4BFBAC45968A80F5.title: "Raise the Star Spire"
	quest.4C78408E6835BC56.quest_desc: [
		"Hunt an animal. Large prey drops large hides; carry a knife to butcher it."
	]
	quest.4C78408E6835BC56.title: "Hunter"
	quest.4CA32185961FD920.quest_desc: ["Calcination turns minerals into alchemical salt."]
	quest.4CA32185961FD920.title: "Calcination Oven"
	quest.4CB0E2CEF90AD9CE.quest_desc: ["Ice shards from Glacio go into the Quantum Core."]
	quest.4CB0E2CEF90AD9CE.title: "Ice Shards"
	quest.4CB43131B416FB17.quest_desc: ["Thirty-two calorite plates."]
	quest.4CB43131B416FB17.title: "Calorite Plates"
	quest.4CBDFA0CE2A9C85C.quest_desc: [
		"The thermoelectric boiler and the industrial turbine turn reactor heat into FE."
	]
	quest.4CBDFA0CE2A9C85C.title: "Industrial Turbine"
	quest.4D29DE0763D2A602.quest_desc: [
		"A fired jug carries fresh water. Drink from it when you are away from rivers."
	]
	quest.4D29DE0763D2A602.title: "Fresh Water"
	quest.4D42F86F954FD88C.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion powers the Quantum Age. The Draconic reactor of the next Age powers the Stargate."
	]
	quest.4D42F86F954FD88C.title: "Power for the End"
	quest.4D478E63C575E42A.quest_desc: [
		"LV, MV and HV wire each take their own connectors. Transformers join the tiers."
		"Wire that carries too much power burns."
	]
	quest.4D478E63C575E42A.title: "Voltage"
	quest.4D59CA22796434A3.quest_desc: [
		"Build the 3x3x3 coke oven from coke bricks and form it with the Engineer's Hammer."
		"It cokes TFC bituminous coal and lignite and gives creosote."
	]
	quest.4D59CA22796434A3.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.4E8C8CCFFBD993C1.quest_desc: [
		"A blaze enchanter enchants with liquid experience. No more enchanting table luck."
	]
	quest.4E8C8CCFFBD993C1.title: "Enchantment Industry"
	quest.4EAD51182D51E618.quest_desc: [
		"The IE blast furnace makes TFC steel from wrought iron and coke."
	]
	quest.4EAD51182D51E618.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.4EC4BBA27265C3E1.quest_desc: ["Hypertubes shoot players across the base."]
	quest.4EC4BBA27265C3E1.title: "Hypertubes"
	quest.4F513B23D9320098.quest_desc: [
		"Forge the Ultimate Singularity from the nine relics, chaos shards, the singular alloy and the"
		"chaotic core in a chaotic fusion. Confirm here when it is done."
	]
	quest.4F513B23D9320098.title: "The Ultimate Singularity"
	quest.4F85BB08A2142E6A.quest_desc: [
		"Carve a flute. Totemic ceremonies and totem poles give the camp some flair."
	]
	quest.4F85BB08A2142E6A.title: "Totemic"
	quest.4F89B63F08027F21.quest_desc: [
		"The simulation chamber turns a trained model and FE into prediction matrices."
	]
	quest.4F89B63F08027F21.title: "Simulation Chamber"
	quest.4FC3CDC1654522C0.quest_desc: ["Bind the Marid, the strongest spirit of Occultism."]
	quest.4FC3CDC1654522C0.title: "Bind a Marid"
	quest.4FD3780AF1ECC795.quest_desc: ["Awakened draconium needs a dragon heart and Nether Stars."]
	quest.4FD3780AF1ECC795.title: "Nether Stars"
	quest.50299FDC54036A8A.quest_desc: ["Craft a quern and a handstone."]
	quest.50299FDC54036A8A.title: "The Grind"
	quest.50B1CD95742F5B7B.quest_desc: ["Build a pumpjack over an oil reservoir."]
	quest.50B1CD95742F5B7B.title: "Pumpjack"
	quest.5209B9E49235822B.quest_desc: [
		"The last Age. Chaos, the Ultimate Singularity and a Stargate to The Origin."
		""
		"Three strands lead to the final battle: Chaos, Singularity and Stargate."
	]
	quest.5209B9E49235822B.quest_subtitle: "Age 9"
	quest.5209B9E49235822B.title: "Welcome to the Singularity Age"
	quest.5298B856BFEE50A2.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Hearthstone: the fired hearth idol, copper ingots and charcoal."
		""
		"Lay it on the plinth of the Hearth Circle (use it on the plinth or on the heart)."
		"Kindle the heart with a firestarter. Then sneak and hold use on the heart with an empty hand"
		"and pray until Caelum answers. Friends who pray with you make it faster."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Hearthstone as a relic and opens the Bronze Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.5298B856BFEE50A2.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Stone Age: Caelum opens the Bronze Age"
	quest.5298B856BFEE50A2.title: "Offer the Hearthstone at the Shrine"
	quest.532C13282586CA95.quest_desc: ["Destroy the crystals, then the dragon."]
	quest.532C13282586CA95.title: "The Ender Dragon"
	quest.53348C90243DE4F0.quest_desc: [
		"Everybody on the server is in the same FTB team. Quest progress, Ages and rewards are shared."
		"Split the strands between you: one friend smiths, one prospects, one builds."
	]
	quest.53348C90243DE4F0.title: "One Team"
	quest.533C7CC2EEA570E4.quest_desc: [
		"Purification gives three times the metal from every ore piece."
	]
	quest.533C7CC2EEA570E4.title: "Purification Chamber"
	quest.545F7082DA91E6D0.quest_desc: [
		"A sculptor waits on a mountain top. Pass the climb to earn the geomancer gear."
	]
	quest.545F7082DA91E6D0.title: "The Sculptor"
	quest.55A04983F152F598.quest_desc: [
		"The arc furnace takes over alloying from the alloy kiln. Old stations stay in the world,"
		"but their recipes move to the new one."
	]
	quest.55A04983F152F598.title: "Stations Retire"
	quest.55D7F2DF060D309F.quest_desc: ["Carry the rotation to your machines."]
	quest.55D7F2DF060D309F.title: "Shafts and Cogs"
	quest.5628873FCDD13028.quest_desc: [
		"A Starbuncle carries items between chests: the item transport of the Arcane Age."
	]
	quest.5628873FCDD13028.title: "Starbuncle"
	quest.573FF798650E3338.quest_desc: [
		"Firmament Ages is a TerraFirmaCraft pack in Ages: Dawn, then Age 0 to Age 9."
		"The whole server is one team with one shared progress."
		""
		"Press K to open this quest screen at any time. There is no quest book item."
	]
	quest.573FF798650E3338.quest_subtitle: "Read me first"
	quest.573FF798650E3338.title: "Welcome to Firmament Ages"
	quest.57663DC8E013A906.quest_desc: [
		"The archmage spellbook needs a Mekanism advanced control circuit."
	]
	quest.57663DC8E013A906.title: "Archmage"
	quest.57F5B8C4363E589D.quest_desc: ["The Chaos Guardian waits on a Chaos Island in the End."]
	quest.57F5B8C4363E589D.title: "Chaos Guardian"
	quest.586717CB0F9BF963.quest_desc: [
		"In the Stone Age your team raises one shrine: a heart of fired clay in a circle of stone,"
		"logs and thatch. It is the hearth of the whole server and the altar of Caelum, the Firmament:"
		"the sky that watches every fire lit beneath it, and opens one layer for every gift."
		""
		"Every Age from the Stone Age on ends at the shrine. Add the Age's ring, lay its signature item"
		"on the new plinth and pray. Caelum answers with light and a word, keeps the gift as a relic"
		"and opens the next Age for everyone."
	]
	quest.586717CB0F9BF963.title: "The Shrine and Caelum"
	quest.5A0D6C8DEDA78181.quest_desc: ["A guardian of the End waits in its ruins."]
	quest.5A0D6C8DEDA78181.title: "Ender Guardian"
	quest.5ACC660E88F7FC61.quest_desc: ["Every Mekanism machine starts with a steel casing."]
	quest.5ACC660E88F7FC61.title: "Steel Casing"
	quest.5AFB81560199F553.quest_desc: ["The induction matrix stores huge amounts of FE."]
	quest.5AFB81560199F553.title: "Induction Matrix"
	quest.5B849EF8FE147622.quest_desc: ["Reinforced blast bricks and preheaters make steel faster."]
	quest.5B849EF8FE147622.title: "Improved Blast Furnace"
	quest.5C0C8D3E5C081AA2.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble the Stargate and power it from the Draconic reactor through a flux gate."
	]
	quest.5C0C8D3E5C081AA2.title: "Gate Online"
	quest.5C1872FCA111DFAA.quest_desc: ["Rockets start from a launch pad."]
	quest.5C1872FCA111DFAA.title: "Launch Pad"
	quest.5C8E39BBE00603BA.quest_desc: [
		"Nine signature items, one Singularity, one gate. Beyond it waits the final boss"
		"of The Origin. Its fall is the end of the road."
	]
	quest.5C8E39BBE00603BA.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 9: defeat the final boss in The Origin"
	quest.5C8E39BBE00603BA.title: "Beyond the Firmament"
	quest.5CC2939838550FB5.quest_desc: [
		"Feed a wild animal to familiarize it. Tame animals are the start of a farm."
	]
	quest.5CC2939838550FB5.title: "A New Friend"
	quest.5D192D80646308F9.quest_desc: ["Bring home a raw hide. A large one makes the thatch bed."]
	quest.5D192D80646308F9.title: "Raw Hide"
	quest.5D31E5FF6DE9E042.quest_desc: ["Create trains and Steam 'n' Rails connect distant mines."]
	quest.5D31E5FF6DE9E042.title: "Trains"
	quest.5DB9500F2C943C21.quest_desc: ["A metal giant waits in a deep chamber. Strike its back."]
	quest.5DB9500F2C943C21.title: "Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.5EE630041C685EFA.quest_desc: [
		"The assembler autocrafts grid recipes: the autocrafting of this Age."
	]
	quest.5EE630041C685EFA.title: "Assembler"
	quest.5EE99FD47DD299FC.quest_desc: [
		"The supercritical phase shifter turns polonium into antimatter."
	]
	quest.5EE99FD47DD299FC.title: "SPS"
	quest.5F3D1DE20EF6632E.quest_desc: [
		"Off-world you need a space suit and oxygen. An oxygen distributor fills a sealed base."
	]
	quest.5F3D1DE20EF6632E.title: "Oxygen and Gravity"
	quest.5F74A3FDB04E14F6.quest_desc: [
		"Immersive Engineering arrives: coke ovens, blast furnaces, crushers, presses and the first FE."
		"Your team also gets a chunk claim and force-load quota with this Age."
		""
		"Four strands lead to the Pressure Core: Coke & Steel, Power, Ore Line and Logistics & Backfill."
	]
	quest.5F74A3FDB04E14F6.quest_subtitle: "Age 4"
	quest.5F74A3FDB04E14F6.title: "Welcome to the Industrial Age"
	quest.612BEB27F9AD5018.quest_desc: ["Land on Mars."]
	quest.612BEB27F9AD5018.title: "Mars"
	quest.617B394599496EE7.quest_desc: [
		"Fuel assemblies hold the fissile fuel in the fission reactor."
	]
	quest.617B394599496EE7.title: "Fuel Assemblies"
	quest.61CA7DDBEC00EDEF.quest_desc: [
		"The Quantum Core is the ninth relic. The Singularity Age has no offering: it ends in battle."
	]
	quest.61CA7DDBEC00EDEF.title: "The Last Offering"
	quest.61EE57DC75EED266.quest_desc: [
		"Feed the bloomery by machine and collect 32 wrought iron ingots from the line."
	]
	quest.61EE57DC75EED266.title: "Automated Bloomery Line"
	quest.623C908B3CDF2E3E.quest_desc: ["Thirty-two desh plates from the metal press."]
	quest.623C908B3CDF2E3E.title: "Desh Plates"
	quest.6281CB502F09533D.quest_desc: [
		"Build the Spirit Circle around the Iron Sanctum: an 11 by 11 border of sourcestone, four"
		"otherstone corner pillars three high with source gem block caps, eight candles on the border"
		"and the fourth plinth in the middle of the north side."
		"When the ring stands, the heart is ready for the Arcane Keystone."
	]
	quest.6281CB502F09533D.quest_subtitle: "Optional: the shrine ring of this Age"
	quest.6281CB502F09533D.title: "Raise the Spirit Circle"
	quest.6362412D5C02D234.quest_desc: [
		"AE2 is the one storage and autocrafting network from this Age. Tom's Simple Storage retires,"
		"and the IE LV and MV capacitors give way to Mekanism energy cubes."
	]
	quest.6362412D5C02D234.title: "One Network"
	quest.63A45BCAE3254E00.quest_desc: [
		"Fell a tree with your stone axe. With axe, knife, hammer and shovel you have a full stone kit."
	]
	quest.63A45BCAE3254E00.title: "Stone Kit"
	quest.640D444A5C7F6051.quest_desc: [
		"From the Iron Age the FTB Chunks map and minimap work. Claims and chunk loading come later."
	]
	quest.640D444A5C7F6051.title: "The Map Opens"
	quest.64CDFFD93C9CBDCE.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Data Matrix: four blue steel sheets, four advanced control circuits,"
		"a 64k storage component and a bottle of dragon's breath."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its seventh ring, the Data Nave: a 17 by 17 border of certus quartz blocks,"
		"steel casing bases, quartz glass two high and fluix block caps."
		"Lay the Data Matrix on the new plinth and pray at the heart together: Caelum wants a chorus"
		"of at least two of you (alone, one is enough)."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Data Matrix as a relic and opens the Space Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.64CDFFD93C9CBDCE.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Information Age: Caelum opens the Space Age"
	quest.64CDFFD93C9CBDCE.title: "Offer the Data Matrix at the Shrine"
	quest.64E0D1AE8C5265E7.quest_desc: [
		"Build the End portal frame, fill it with eyes of ender and step through."
	]
	quest.64E0D1AE8C5265E7.title: "The End"
	quest.6522D484BFB67425.quest_desc: [
		"Knap a tool head from two rocks and put it on a stick in the crafting grid."
		"An axe comes first. A knife, a hammer and a shovel follow the same way."
	]
	quest.6522D484BFB67425.title: "Paleolithic!"
	quest.652657C4C5B8CAC5.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 2: Iron Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.652657C4C5B8CAC5.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 2: Iron Age"
	quest.652657C4C5B8CAC5.title: "Steel Heart"
	quest.6541A11C39B620C6.quest_desc: [
		"The distillation tower splits crude oil into diesel, lubricant and more."
	]
	quest.6541A11C39B620C6.title: "Distillation Tower"
	quest.6567773B43A82031.quest_desc: [
		"A Starbuncle on a wheel turns Create shafts. Magic and kinetics meet."
	]
	quest.6567773B43A82031.title: "Ars Creo"
	quest.659EBC46D8F70B24.quest_desc: [
		"Sourcelinks turn fuel, growth or life around them into source. Store it in source jars."
	]
	quest.659EBC46D8F70B24.title: "Sourcelink"
	quest.65E696893D25C27D.quest_desc: ["The fusion reactor is the FE source of this Age."]
	quest.65E696893D25C27D.title: "Fusion Reactor"
	quest.661054914CDF7CFA.quest_desc: [
		"FE is the one energy unit of the pack. Create rotation (SU) has one bridge: the alternator"
		"turns SU into FE and the electric motor turns FE back into SU."
	]
	quest.661054914CDF7CFA.title: "FE and SU"
	quest.6630236A99A2E2D5.quest_desc: [
		"A stock link and a stock ticker show and request your stock from anywhere on the network."
	]
	quest.6630236A99A2E2D5.title: "Stock Ticker"
	quest.663A4EAE1B3FAF8C.quest_desc: [
		"The signature item of Age 4: Industrial Age. Details appear when the Age before it is done."
	]
	quest.663A4EAE1B3FAF8C.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Age 4: Industrial Age"
	quest.663A4EAE1B3FAF8C.title: "Pressure Core"
	quest.66EDA08DBD082046.quest_desc: [
		"Saw support beams and place them in your mine. They stop cave-ins nearby."
	]
	quest.66EDA08DBD082046.title: "Hold the Ceiling"
	quest.6708655329216D20.quest_desc: ["A filled hohlraum and a laser ignite the reactor."]
	quest.6708655329216D20.title: "Hohlraum"
	quest.67314514BDCA1DB3.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse the Quantum Core at draconic level: the awakened core as catalyst, two antimatter"
		"pellets, two calorite plates, two ice shards and the Leviathan's abyssal egg."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its ninth ring, the Quantum Ring: a 21 by 21 border of calorite blocks,"
		"SPS casings or fusion reactor frames two high and awakened draconium pylons."
		"Lay the Quantum Core on the new plinth and pray together at night under an open sky:"
		"Caelum wants a chorus of at least two of you and the stars."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Quantum Core as its last relic and opens the Singularity Age."
	]
	quest.67314514BDCA1DB3.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Quantum Age: Caelum opens the Singularity Age"
	quest.67314514BDCA1DB3.title: "Offer the Quantum Core at the Shrine"
	quest.67CA15BF14B359A8.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion crafting needs a core, injectors of the right tier and FE. Wyvern items need wyvern"
		"injectors. Every tool and armor piece has a direct recipe: no gear goes into better gear."
	]
	quest.67CA15BF14B359A8.title: "Fusion Crafting"
	quest.68A4B5AC4EBE2085.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the Pressure Core: two black steel double sheets, a heavy engineering block,"
		"the Arcane Gearbox and the horn of the Netherite Monstrosity."
		""
		"Grow the shrine by its fifth ring, the Foundry Nave: a 13 by 13 border of coke bricks,"
		"heavy engineering block bases, steel scaffolding three high and electric lanterns on top."
		"Lay the Pressure Core on the new plinth, power the four electric lanterns and pray at the heart."
		""
		"Caelum keeps the Pressure Core as a relic and opens the Electric Age for the whole team."
	]
	quest.68A4B5AC4EBE2085.quest_subtitle: "Goal of the Industrial Age: Caelum opens the Electric Age"
	quest.68A4B5AC4EBE2085.title: "Offer the Pressure Core at the Shrine"
	quest.68D0F147E4B64250.quest_desc: ["Scylla rules a storm-wracked sea. A hard optional fight."]
	quest.68D0F147E4B64250.title: "Scylla"
	quest.692BE6A196CEF07F.quest_desc: ["Land on the Moon."]
	quest.692BE6A196CEF07F.title: "The Moon"
	quest.69CB2309855D14E1.quest_desc: [
		"The novice spellbook casts the first spells and opens the Ars Nouveau worn notebook."
	]
	quest.69CB2309855D14E1.title: "Novice Spellbook"
	quest.69FBE953FD290F68.quest_desc: ["Mine calorite on Venus."]
	quest.69FBE953FD290F68.title: "Calorite"
	quest.6A1C715211FCA0FB.quest_desc: ["Two black steel double sheets for the Pressure Core."]
	quest.6A1C715211FCA0FB.title: "Black Steel Double Sheets"
	quest.6A80066F26918539.quest_desc: [
		"Dig a 2x2 pool of water ringed by grass or dirt, put flowers around it and throw polished quartz into"
		"the water. Polished quartz comes from the quartz veins of the Iron Age, polished with sandpaper."
		"Step through."
	]
	quest.6A80066F26918539.title: "Into the Twilight"
	quest.6ABCB02049FE872B.quest_desc: ["Knap and fire a crucible. It mixes metals into alloys."]
	quest.6ABCB02049FE872B.title: "The Crucible"
	quest.6B502DAD3EAE52D5.quest_desc: [
		"The apprentice spellbook holds the stronger glyphs you need against the Wilden Chimera."
	]
	quest.6B502DAD3EAE52D5.title: "Apprentice Spellbook"
	quest.6B60917A5984A799.quest_desc: ["The awakened core is the catalyst of the Quantum Core."]
	quest.6B60917A5984A799.title: "Awakened Core"
	quest.6C112D72835F57BD.quest_desc: [
		"Crushing wheels turn ore pieces into dust for more metal per ore."
	]
	quest.6C112D72835F57BD.title: "Crushing Wheels"
	quest.6C6E95AB6ABD2B3E.quest_desc: [
		"Create 6 packages: the packager boxes items for the network."
	]
	quest.6C6E95AB6ABD2B3E.title: "Packager"
	quest.6C89D8CCD3EEFE88.quest_desc: [
		"Source gems in a steel gearbox. A Wixie can automate it. It goes into the reinforced"
		"blast bricks and into the Pressure Core."
	]
	quest.6C89D8CCD3EEFE88.title: "Arcane Gearbox"
	quest.6CBAA83920DDC925.quest_desc: ["Ostrum builds the tier 3 rocket for Venus and Mercury."]
	quest.6CBAA83920DDC925.title: "Tier 3 Rocket"
	quest.6DC5BE16C605C596.quest_desc: [
		"Blue steel is the Age 6 metal. The Data Matrix needs four sheets."
	]
	quest.6DC5BE16C605C596.title: "Blue Steel"
	quest.6DE0808A3F92C2E7.quest_desc: [
		"Put the head on a stick. Your first pickaxe: now you can mine."
	]
	quest.6DE0808A3F92C2E7.title: "Copper Pickaxe"
	quest.6DE17D691978916D.quest_desc: [
		"Soak a hide in limewater, scrape it, then soak it in tannin."
	]
	quest.6DE17D691978916D.title: "Genuine Leather"
	quest.6E4438CCF1A5BF3D.quest_desc: ["The Lich drops its trophy. The Steel Heart needs it."]
	quest.6E4438CCF1A5BF3D.title: "Lich Trophy"
	quest.6F0E9B4D0BD4227A.quest_desc: [
		"The IE crusher grinds TFC ore pieces into mineral powder and canonical dust: twice the metal,"
		"plus a by-product."
	]
	quest.6F0E9B4D0BD4227A.title: "Crusher"
	quest.6F9493CFB1887C79.quest_desc: ["Mine desh on the Moon."]
	quest.6F9493CFB1887C79.title: "Desh"
	quest.70B4778AD5C5B83E.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Leviathan in the deep. Its abyssal egg goes into the Quantum Core."
	]
	quest.70B4778AD5C5B83E.title: "The Leviathan"
	quest.70CBE25D834EEF9F.quest_desc: ["Climb the Lich tower and defeat the Lich."]
	quest.70CBE25D834EEF9F.title: "The Lich"
	quest.71013FE9F62EC68E.quest_desc: ["Chaotic injectors fuse at the highest tier."]
	quest.71013FE9F62EC68E.title: "Chaotic Injectors"
	quest.7124AA6401C814BF.quest_desc: ["The DHD dials the gate."]
	quest.7124AA6401C814BF.title: "Dial Home Device"
	quest.713ED981D14D9A4D.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion crafting is the one pedestal crafting of the tech Ages."
	]
	quest.713ED981D14D9A4D.title: "Fusion Crafting Core"
	quest.716420BDBE218479.quest_desc: ["Fuse draconium blocks with a dragon heart and Nether Stars."]
	quest.716420BDBE218479.title: "Awakened Draconium"
	quest.71A054B30C7FB195.quest_desc: [
		"Train a data model to tier 3 (Superior) and keep it running in a simulation chamber."
	]
	quest.71A054B30C7FB195.title: "Data Model: Tier 3"
	quest.71AC4F9CCF7E6538.quest_desc: ["Certus quartz comes from its own vein."]
	quest.71AC4F9CCF7E6538.title: "Certus Quartz"
	quest.71B6B8FAE5353DAB.quest_desc: [
		"Build a charcoal forge: charcoal on the ground, surrounded by stone."
	]
	quest.71B6B8FAE5353DAB.title: "Forging"
	quest.724BED62EE9DF8FB.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a firestarter from two sticks. Throw a log, three sticks and some straw on one block"
		"and hold use on it with the firestarter until the firepit lights."
		""
		"Fire opens the Stone Age for the whole team: clay, pit kilns and the first copper."
	]
	quest.724BED62EE9DF8FB.quest_subtitle: "Goal of Dawn: grants the Stone Age"
	quest.724BED62EE9DF8FB.title: "The First Spark"
	quest.72A1265F53716B52.quest_desc: [
		"The fabricator turns matrices into mob drops, boss drops included."
	]
	quest.72A1265F53716B52.title: "Loot Fabricator"
	quest.72A754A7D51FBA06.quest_desc: ["Galena veins are visible now. Lead goes into capacitors."]
	quest.72A754A7D51FBA06.title: "Lead"
	quest.72DBAB3B1C9E0AD4.quest_desc: ["Electrum wire carries medium voltage."]
	quest.72DBAB3B1C9E0AD4.title: "MV Wire"
	quest.72E155A942A5A2F6.quest_desc: ["Vacuum tubes are the first electronics."]
	quest.72E155A942A5A2F6.title: "Vacuum Tubes"
	quest.72FDA51E1B8B0984.quest_desc: [
		"Some rocks on the surface are ore. Remember where you found them."
	]
	quest.72FDA51E1B8B0984.title: "A Weird Rock"
	quest.7317EE63A824831B.quest_desc: ["A Create jetpack flies on compressed air from its tank."]
	quest.7317EE63A824831B.title: "Jetpack"
	quest.73CDE4A02F764C5D.quest_desc: ["Draconium ore lies in the End."]
	quest.73CDE4A02F764C5D.title: "Draconium"
	quest.73D3949D8DE47C1A.quest_desc: ["Awakened draconium is the reactor's fuel."]
	quest.73D3949D8DE47C1A.title: "Reactor Fuel"
	quest.7448E77754C5FDAD.quest_desc: [
		"Till soil with a hoe and plant the seeds. Crops need water and time."
	]
	quest.7448E77754C5FDAD.title: "First Field"
	quest.7479AAADAC50C431.quest_desc: ["Write the Marid's name into a book of binding."]
	quest.7479AAADAC50C431.title: "Book of Binding: Marid"
	quest.750293899E6D4B62.quest_desc: ["Silicon is printed into every processor."]
	quest.750293899E6D4B62.title: "Silicon"
	quest.7544B0CD7D29A814.quest_desc: ["Calorite builds the tier 4 rocket for Glacio."]
	quest.7544B0CD7D29A814.title: "Tier 4 Rocket"
	quest.7594B03DF7F3FE55.quest_desc: [
		"Build a bloomery from bronze double sheets and stone bricks."
	]
	quest.7594B03DF7F3FE55.title: "Ironworks"
	quest.759550A45990B3C8.quest_desc: [
		"Fill the small vessel with copper ore, heat it until the copper melts,"
		"then pour it into the ingot mold."
	]
	quest.759550A45990B3C8.title: "Copper Ingot"
	quest.7633534E257B8AD8.quest_desc: [
		"The alternator turns Create rotation into FE. It is the only bridge from SU to FE."
	]
	quest.7633534E257B8AD8.title: "Alternator"
	quest.77217628E2664B69.quest_desc: ["A black steel anvil works black steel double sheets."]
	quest.77217628E2664B69.title: "Black Steel Anvil"
	quest.772B64FC091E11AB.quest_desc: [
		"Two HV capacitors: one buffers your grid, one goes into the Humming Core."
	]
	quest.772B64FC091E11AB.title: "Grid Online"
	quest.774C554B16ACE98C.quest_desc: [
		"A classic Stargate takes one base block, nine chevron blocks and fourteen ring blocks."
		"The Ultimate Singularity goes into the base block."
	]
	quest.774C554B16ACE98C.title: "Stargate Blocks"
	quest.7755ECDE0FFE3821.quest_desc: [
		"Fire a second Hearth Idol and set it in three cobblestone under a charcoal:"
		"that is the Shrine Heart."
		"Place it where your team wants its shrine. There is only one shrine in the world,"
		"and every later Age adds a ring around it, so leave room: about 21 by 21 blocks."
	]
	quest.7755ECDE0FFE3821.title: "The Shrine Heart"
	quest.7794323527566501.quest_desc: ["Put a fired ceramic pot on the firepit and cook a soup."]
	quest.7794323527566501.title: "Pot Head"
	quest.7883DC5AF7968152.quest_desc: [
		"Nine relics rest on the shrine's plinths. Together they become the Ultimate Singularity."
	]
	quest.7883DC5AF7968152.title: "Nine Relics"
	quest.7997DC1DFF73EA36.quest_desc: [
		"Stack logs in a log pile, cover it with earth and light it: a charcoal pit."
		"Charcoal burns hot enough for copper."
	]
	quest.7997DC1DFF73EA36.title: "A Better Fuel"
	quest.79BD86B5CD663079.quest_desc: [
		"The alloy kiln alloys two metals in TFC ratios. It retires with the Electric Age."
	]
	quest.79BD86B5CD663079.title: "Alloy Kiln"
	quest.79DA4E6D4518762C.quest_desc: ["Deuterium and tritium make the fuel."]
	quest.79DA4E6D4518762C.title: "Fusion Fuel"
	quest.7B0276B3AACDABA7.quest_desc: ["Draconic-level fusion needs awakened injectors."]
	quest.7B0276B3AACDABA7.title: "Awakened Injectors"
	quest.7CDF23C64D3D4961.quest_desc: [
		"Food rots. Sealed large vessels, salting, drying and cooking slow it down."
		"Eat from every food group: grain, fruit, vegetables, protein and dairy."
	]
	quest.7CDF23C64D3D4961.title: "Food Decay and Nutrition"
	quest.7E4228F48F8BE9EF.quest_desc: ["Knap five clay into a vessel, a jug, a bowl or a mold."]
	quest.7E4228F48F8BE9EF.title: "Clay Forming"
	quest.7ECFFB6EEDF1B9FB.quest_desc: ["Steel wire carries high voltage over long distances."]
	quest.7ECFFB6EEDF1B9FB.title: "HV Wire"
